 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nThe Spring 2026 Maker-in-Residence \, Emma
  McKee\, AKA the “StitchGawd” is a Chicago-based cross-stitcher and fi
 ber artist whose work uses traditional heritage methods to focus and highl
 ight contemporary cultural commentary\, the visual zeitgeist and social hi
 story. She is known for her one of a kind stitched pieces for athletes and
  artists including Kendrick Lamar\, SZA\, Chief Keef\, Saba\, Smino\, Cand
 ace Parker\, Zach Lavine\, Allen Iverson\, and Brittney Griner. Stop by Su
 lzer's 2nd floor Maker Space \\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocomm
 ons.com/events/6a4577c1a03157457d04f0e3
